# HW2 Service

## Compile

Run `make` in this directory.

## Broker

The broker provides RPC methods for publishing and retieving events.

Before running the broker, make sure the rpcbind service is running.

```
./broker
```

## Publisher

The publisher publishes events to the broker. An event is a tuple of (topic_name, int_value).

```
./publisher broker_host_name topic_name topic_value
```

## Retriever

The Retriever fetches events from the broker for a provided topic name.

```
./receiver broker_host_name topic_name
```